Z||000015||chester||06-22-2001||08:10 AM||||Here are the specifics on my car;<P>Suspension:<P>Coilovers front and rear with carrera shocks<BR>and 300# springs all in chrome.<BR>All tube control arms from RCC front and rear<BR>RCC anti bumpsteer kit<BR>All poly bushings.<BR>1" sway bar front 7/8" swaybar rear.<P>Brakes:<P>11" vented disk with GM intermediate calipers<BR>SS braided brake lines<BR>92 Blazer master cylinder<BR>(yes, the emergency brake works!)<P>Engine:<P>2.8 punched .030<BR>TRW forged pistons<BR>cloydes true double roller timing chain<BR>2030 crane cam<BR>crane lifters and pushrods<BR>1:1.6 comp cams roller tip rockers<BR>SS valves<BR>mild port/polish on heads <BR>heads shaved .020<BR>Accell 19# injectors<BR>Adjustable fuel pressure regulator with guage<BR>Hi volume oil pump<BR>windage tray<BR>ARP hardware throughout<BR>custom tube headers by Steve Hamm<BR>2 1/4 exhaust coupled to a modified flowmaster 40 series (yet to be installed)<BR>MSD 6AL ignition<BR>poly motor and cradle mounts<BR>Magnacore 10MM wires<BR>Accel electronic coil.<BR>Cold air induction from Fiero Shop in canada<P>Interior:<P>Alpine 855 head unit<BR>Kicker plate with 8" sub behind passenger seat.<BR>Chrome roll bar.<BR>Custom 3rd brake light<BR>Autometer air/fuel mixture guage and shift light.<BR>Grey marble dash kit.<P>Upgrades in the works:<P>Haltec programmable ECM<BR>Garret T3 turbo<BR>Grey leather seatcovers<BR>Digital dash setup.<P>WHEW! I think that about covers it!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>FieroKyle you think its ricey? - Bah Humbug!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000016||chester||06-22-2001||08:13 AM||||Oh yeah, the rims are Smiths Performance Revolutions in a 17" X 7.5"<P>Dunlop SP9000 rubber all the way around.<BR>215/40R17 fronts and 245/40R17 in the rear.<P>Rob D.||||reg||1
Z||000017||chester||06-22-2001||08:25 AM||||I also missed the hi flow fuel pump<BR>full balance<BR>bored throttle body and plenum.<BR>centerforce dual friction clutch<BR>105 amp red powdercoat alternator<BR>power pulley kit<P>||||reg||1
